  random intercept only                      logL   -3342.25   AIC    6704.5   converged
  + random slope on arousal                  logL   -3338.98   AIC    6702.0   converged
  + random slope on arousal and arousal^2    logL   -3368.57   AIC    6767.1   DID NOT CONVERGE

  LRT random intercept only -> + random slope on arousal:
     chi2(2) = 6.52, p = 0.0384 (boundary-corrected p = 0.0245)

  LRT + random slope on arousal -> + random slope on arousal and arousal^2:
     chi2(3) = -59.18, p = 1.0000 (boundary-corrected p = 1.0000)

